---
import SectionHeader from './SectionHeader.astro';
import CredentialCard from './CredentialCard.astro';
import { cmiDiploma, platformBadges } from '../data/credentials';
---
<section class="section section-rule" id="credentials">
  <div class="wrap">
    <SectionHeader num="04" eyebrow="Credentials">
      Why an independent practice <em>and not a Big Five team?</em>
    </SectionHeader>

    <div class="credentials">
      <CredentialCard
        glyph="15"
        glyphSuffix="+"
        title="Hands-on CDE delivery, not delegated to juniors"
        tags={['Bentley BCDE', 'ProjectWise', 'Viewpoint', 'Asite', 'Autodesk Docs', 'Dalux']}
        badges={platformBadges}
      >
        Every engagement is led by a practitioner with primary platform
        experience &mdash; including delivery on schemes spanning health,
        infrastructure, and housebuilding.
      </CredentialCard>

      <CredentialCard
        glyph="ISO"
        glyphMono
        title="19650-native — built up from the standard, not retrofitted"
        tags={['ISO 19650-1:2018', '-2:2018', '-3:2020', '-5:2020', 'BS 1192-4', 'ISO 19650:2026']}
      >
        Our frameworks, templates and audit logic begin with the clause-level
        text of ISO 19650-1 through -5. Nothing is bolted on later because
        nothing was bolted on at the start.
      </CredentialCard>

      <CredentialCard
        glyph="UK"
        title="Native to the UK regulatory environment"
        tags={['BSA 2022', 'Golden Thread', 'EIR / BEP', 'NEC4 IM annex', 'JCT alignment']}
      >
        Building Safety Act Golden Thread, EIR &amp; BEP authoring under
        UK procurement norms, and the emerging ISO&nbsp;19650:2026
        transition. We are based in Wales and operate UK-wide.
      </CredentialCard>

      <CredentialCard
        glyph="CMI"
        glyphMono
        title="Formally qualified in the practice of consulting itself"
        tags={['CMI Level 7', 'Professional Consulting', 'Client engagement', 'Assignment delivery', 'Consulting ethics']}
        badges={[cmiDiploma]}
      >
        The CMI Level&nbsp;7 Diploma in Professional Consulting is the
        postgraduate-level benchmark for the consulting profession &mdash;
        client engagement, assignment delivery, and professional ethics.
        Awarded 2026 and independently verifiable through the Chartered
        Management Institute.
      </CredentialCard>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
